---
const TEL = "0120-442-999";
---

<section class="final-cta">
	<div class="l-container final-cta__row">
		<p class="final-cta__text">
			お悩みは今すぐ解決できます<br />まずはお気軽にご相談ください
		</p>
		<div class="final-cta__buttons">
			<a href={`tel:${TEL.replace(/-/g, "")}`} class="btn-cta btn-cta--phone">電話でお問い合わせ</a>
			<a href="https://lin.ee/zZWo2lf" class="btn-cta btn-cta--line" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LINEでお問い合わせ</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.final-cta {
		background: var(--color-primary-lighter);
	}

	.final-cta__row {
		padding-block: 28px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 16px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.final-cta__text {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 18px;
		color: #fff;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.final-cta__buttons {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: nowrap;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 12px;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.final-cta__buttons .btn-cta {
		flex: 1 1 0;
		min-width: 0;
		padding-inline: 10px;
		font-size: 12px;
		white-space: normal;
		line-height: 1.3;
	}

	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.final-cta__row {
			flex-direction: row;
			justify-content: space-between;
			text-align: left;
		}

		.final-cta__buttons {
			flex-wrap: nowrap;
			width: auto;
		}

		.final-cta__buttons .btn-cta {
			flex: 0 0 auto;
			padding-inline: 24px;
			font-size: 13px;
			white-space: nowrap;
		}
	}
</style>
